BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:e58e1758ae5b7fdb@zcyber-gtm.local
DTSTAMP:20260706T162517Z
DTSTART:20260706T190000Z
DTEND:20260706T210000Z
SUMMARY:⚡ Magnetic Magic: Learn the Hall Effect by Soldering (CHM)
DESCRIPTION:Noisebridge Hackerspace Ever wondered how electronics can detect a magnet without anything touching? In this beginner-friendly workshop\, you'll solder a simple Hall effect sensor kit while exploring the fascinating physics behind magnetic fields. No soldering experience is required—we'll guide you through every step\, explain the basics in plain English\, and have plenty of time for questions. Whether you're curious about electronics\, magnets\, or just want to build something fun with your own hands\, you'll leave with a working project\, new skills\, and maybe even a little bit of magnetic magic. | Source: DC415 San Francisco | Tags: security | https://www.meetup.com/noisebridge/events/314957095/
LOCATION:
URL:https://www.meetup.com/noisebridge/events/314957095/
END:VEVENT
