SUMMARY:Burbsec North - Sponsored by Torq
DESCRIPTION:BurbSec Chicago: The Midwest's Favorite Cybersecurity Events BurbSec North is the Northern Suburb offshoot of the famous Chicagoland BurbSec meetups. Information Security enthusiasts of all skill and career levels are welcome to join us for a few beers and complaints about work (or the lack thereof)! We average about 10-15 attendees each month\, many of whom have been coming for years! Our location offers excellent beers as well as a full pub menu! Finally\, don't forget to join the BurbSec chat servers! Our Discord service is very active. BurbSec Discord: ([https://discord.gg/VVYDZYmd2w](https://discord.gg/VVYDZYmd2w)) Bluesky: @north.burbsec.com Mastodon: @BurbSecNorth@infosec.exchange Twitter: ([https://twitter.com/burbsecnorth](https://twitter.com/burbsecnorth)) | Source: BurbSec Chicago | Tags: cyber\, cybersecurity\, infosec\, security | https://www.meetup.com/burbsec/events/315218689/
