DTSTART:20260709T193000Z
DTEND:20260709T220000Z
SUMMARY:DC415
DESCRIPTION:Noisebridge Hackerspace This group was created to bring together people who share a passion for cybersecurity and a curiosity about how things work. The goal is simple — to connect with other humans who enjoy meaningful\, inspiring\, and sometimes unexpected security conversations more than just once a year. Many of us have returned from security conferences feeling both inspired and overwhelmed — full of new ideas and projects to explore\, only to have life pull us in other directions. Maybe a demanding client\, a new sprint\, or even a new baby shifted priorities away from that funny blinky badge project sitting on a shelf. If that sounds familiar\, you’re not alone. This meetup offers a space for like-minded individuals to gather once a month\, share what’s captured their attention\, discuss recent exploits or discoveries\, and showcase projects born from curiosity or necessity. Whether it’s a half-finished experiment\, a new idea sparked by a problem\, or something ready for collaboration\, this is a place to share and grow together. Most of all\, this group encourages rediscovering that spark of curiosity — dusting off those badges\, boards\, and brainstorms — and diving once again into the spirit of exploration that brought us all here. | Source: DC415 San Francisco | Tags: cyber\, cybersecurity\, security | https://www.meetup.com/noisebridge/events/315328274/
LOCATION:
URL:https://www.meetup.com/noisebridge/events/315328274/
END:VEVENT
