SUMMARY:Chicago CISO XC Summer Conference
DESCRIPTION:Event organizer: CISO XC Event name: Chicago CISO XC Summer Conference Date/time: July 14\, 2026\, 8:00 AM - 6:00 PM Location: Convene - 311 W Monroe St\, Chicago\, IL\, 60606 Dress code: Business Casual Registration Link: https://www.cisoxc.com/event-details/ciso-xc-chicago-request-for-rsvp-2/form Complimentary for CISOs\, VPs\, Directors and Managers Event Description: The CISO XC Chicago Summer Conference brings together security executives from across the region for a day built around real conversations\, practical insight\, and a trusted community of peers navigating the same challenges. The day features keynote discussions\, interactive breakout sessions\, and closed‑door boardrooms\, all intentionally curated to foster candor\, connection\, and shared learning. We’ll also kick off the morning with the CISO XC Bootcamp\, a focused\, practitioner‑led session for aspiring CISOs\, taught by current sitting CISOs and designed to accelerate readiness for the role. | Source: Chicago InfoSec Events Calendar | Tags: ciso\, infosec\, security | https://www.cisoxc.com/event-details/ciso-xc-chicago-request-for-rsvp-2/form
