SUMMARY:(CS)²AI Fellow Fireside Chat: Leadership Talks on ICS/OT Incident Response
DESCRIPTION:Nashville Cyber Security for Control Systems Register now: [https://events.zoom.us/ev/AkivDxeEU6YytTnJmrnyVsee0zP1b2rE5CyLk6Pu336A0Nk62OI7~Ah52pVBdtgmqAurCaUOUSn-xaVKcQjkvW6OWTFghMWFSph8lNrjNMfL_rs6KE-E1oZ4sZoo6VO8mLtbaHVt7fW9D_A](https://events.zoom.us/ev/AkivDxeEU6YytTnJmrnyVsee0zP1b2rE5CyLk6Pu336A0Nk62OI7~Ah52pVBdtgmqAurCaUOUSn-xaVKcQjkvW6OWTFghMWFSph8lNrjNMfL_rs6KE-E1oZ4sZoo6VO8mLtbaHVt7fW9D_A) When an ICS/OT cybersecurity incident occurs\, board members and CXOs are faced with particular questions\, and our panel of SMEs have been there to answer them. Join us for a CS2AI Fellow Fireside Chat on what most concerns organization leaders with ICS/OT cybersecurity incident response situations. *"Can we isolate the incident without stopping production?"* — Why OT response isn't IT response\, and the tradeoffs between containment and continuity. "How long until we're operational again?" — Setting realistic recovery expectations when safety systems and physical processes are involved. *"What are we legally required to disclose\, and to whom?"* — Regulatory notification timelines and what happens when the incident touches critical infrastructure. *"What preventions/preparations do we have in place for this?"* — What separates organizations with a tested OT incident response plan from those with a document nobody's opened. **Who should attend:** CISOs\, plant and operations leaders\, risk and compliance executives\, and ***anyone who would be in the room during an actual OT incident.*** Register on zoom: https://events.zoom.us/ev/AkivDxeEU6YytTnJmrnyVsee0zP1b2rE5CyLk6Pu336A0Nk62OI7\\~Ah52pVBdtgmqAurCaUOUSn-xaVKcQjkvW6OWTFghMWFSph8lNrjNMfL_rs6KE-E1oZ4sZoo6VO8mLtbaHVt7fW9D_A | Source: Nashville Cyber Security for Control Systems | Tags: ciso\, compliance\, cyber\, cybersecurity\, risk\, security | https://www.meetup.com/nashville-cyber-security-for-control-systems/events/315520686/
LOCATION:
URL:https://www.meetup.com/nashville-cyber-security-for-control-systems/events/315520686/
END:VEVENT
