SUMMARY:Webinar | Securely Adding AI to Your Dev Team
DESCRIPTION:<p>AI coding tools are showing up on dev teams everywhere\, often faster than security can keep up. A lot of leaders want to lean into agents but feel hesitant because of the risks. And with things moving so fast\, it\\'s hard to know where to even start. This beginner-friendly webinar is a starting point. We\\'ll […]</p>\\n | Source: WiCyS Events | Tags: risk\, security | https://www.wicys.org/event/webinar-securely-adding-ai-to-your-dev-team/
