ttps://discord.gg/4hhVPHebJX) Web: http://burbsec.com ([http://burbsec.com/](http://burbsec.com/)) Twitter: @burbsecnw ([https://www.twitter.com/burbsecnw](https://www.twitter.com/burbsecnw)) Mastodon: burbsecnw@infosec.exchange [(https://infosec.exchange/@burbsecnw](https://infosec.exchange/@burbsecnw)) | Source: BurbSec Chicago | Tags: compliance\, cyber\, cybersecurity\, infosec\, security | https://www.meetup.com/burbsec/events/315430393/
